Adds the rs.ltt.jmap data-plane to JmapService, on top of the full 0001-0021
series: resolve the primary mail account (MailAccountCapability), fetch
mailboxes -> EntityFolder (role->type + parent path), fetch message headers via
a single Query+Get MultiCall back-reference (/ids), lazy body fetch, and
Email/set mutations (keywords seen/flagged, move, destroy). Consumed by Core's
JMAP sync branch (batch 4, replacing the ServiceSynchronize TYPE_JMAP skip
guard); send (EmailSubmission) lands in batch 5.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../java/eu/faircode/email/JmapService.java   | 272 +++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 259 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/eu/faircode/email/JmapService.java b/app/src/main/java/eu/faircode/email/JmapService.java
